Every clinician should discuss a higher-opioid-dosage-opioid-use-disorder-risk with a patient.
Every clinician should discuss a higher-opioid-dosage-respiratory-depression-risk with a patient.
Every clinician should discuss a higher-opioid-dosage-death-risk with a patient.
